1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,654
Touch your fingertips, about a hand's length from your eyes.

2
00:00:04,154 --> 00:00:06,801
Now look past them, at something far away.

3
00:00:07,651 --> 00:00:08,046
See it?

4
00:00:08,046 --> 00:00:10,304
A little floating finger, with two tips.

5
00:00:10,804 --> 00:00:12,164
Pull them apart a bit.

6
00:00:12,164 --> 00:00:12,783
It floats.

7
00:00:13,333 --> 00:00:17,669
Your eyes aim far, so each eye sees your fingers in a different place.

8
00:00:17,969 --> 00:00:20,769
Your brain lays both views on top of each other.

9
00:00:21,069 --> 00:00:24,499
Where the two fingertips overlap, you see a floating finger.

10
00:00:24,999 --> 00:00:27,407
Look back at your fingers, and it is gone.
